<h2 dir="ltr">What Makes Space Planning Different in a Luxury Apartment?</h2>
<img class="wp-image-11973 size-full" src="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/living-room-interior-with-lighting-designed-by-oraanj-interiors.jpeg" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" />
<p dir="ltr">In a house, you can often solve a layout problem by adding a wall or an extension. In a London apartment, every decision has to work within a fixed footprint, so the planning has to be right the first time. Good <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/space-planning/">space planning</a> starts with how you actually live, not how the floor plan was originally drawn: where you eat, where guests gather, where you want silence. In a luxury flat, that often means developing technical <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/layout-plan-elevations-autocad-drawings/">architectural AutoCAD joinery drawings</a> to rework circulation routes and sightlines long before a single finish is chosen.</p>

<h2 dir="ltr">How Do You Add Storage Without It Looking Like Storage?</h2>
<img class="alignnone wp-image-12367 size-full" src="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/warm-modern-living-room.webp" alt="" width="1672" height="941" />
<p dir="ltr">Visible storage is the fastest way to make a luxury apartment feel smaller and less considered. The better approach is storage that disappears into the architecture, floor-to-ceiling joinery flush with the wall plane, window seats that open, hallway runs built into what would otherwise be dead space. This is where <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/custom-furniture-design/">custom furniture design</a> earns its cost in a small footprint: off-the-shelf storage wastes space that precision <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/bespoke-joinery-design-london/">bespoke joinery design London</a> simply doesn't. When deciding on the right approach, understanding <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/bespoke-joinery-vs-fitted-furniture-which-is-right-for-your-london-home/">bespoke joinery vs fitted furniture</a> helps determine how integrated your storage should be.</p>

<h3 dir="ltr">What Architectural Details Actually Make an Apartment Feel High-End?</h3>
