<p dir="ltr">It's rarely one big gesture, it's a handful of consistent details done properly. Skirting and cornicing proportioned correctly for the ceiling height, door and window reveals finished with real attention, and exploring different <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/wall-panelling-different-types-to-elevate-your-interiors/">wall panelling types to elevate interiors</a> that align with sightlines rather than being applied as decoration afterwards. This is <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/interior-architecture/">interior architecture</a> work, not styling, and it's usually the difference buyers and guests notice without being able to say exactly why. In luxury developments, commissioning <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/bespoke-furniture-london-custom-pieces-that-transform-your-home/">bespoke furniture in London</a> bridges the gap between structure and refined everyday living.</p>

